| R2 modal did not contain Tab or make siblings inert | `Modal` traps Tab/Shift-Tab inside the topmost dialog, marks lower dialogs `inert` + `aria-hidden`, and the shell marks the rail and page `inert` + `aria-hidden` while any modal is open (`useModalsOpen`); Escape closes the topmost only; each opener regains focus. Test: `modal.test.tsx` with two stacked production `Modal`s | `v2/modal.tsx`, `v2/v2-shell.tsx` |
| R3 toast expiry restarted on re-render | The expiry effect depends on the toast id only and dismisses through the store | `v2/toasts.tsx`; test "does not restart a toast deadline on re-render" |
| R4 ⌘T missing | Go › Switch Tenant… (CmdOrCtrl+T) → `MenuCommand::TenantSwitcher`; v2 opens the switcher without switching, legacy routes to Settings; parser accepts the new command | `menu.rs`, `wire.rs`, `client.ts`, `app.tsx`; tests in `v2-shell.test.tsx`, `desktop-shell.test.tsx`, `menu.rs` |
